WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:19.004
[Gentle music]
SharpLsp is one Rust host with two .NET engines behind it. Watch its log: an F# hover goes to the F# compiler service, and a C# hover goes to Roslyn. Each engine runs in its own process, and speaks MessagePack over a local socket.

00:24.817 --> 00:32.183
Syntax features never leave the host. Folding comes straight from tree-sitter in Rust, with no round trip to either engine.
